option.helptext:
Grants Mutated Humans and True Kin this mod's extra starting skills: Staunch Wounds, Cooking and Gathering, and Meal Preparation, plus Menacing Stare for mutants.
Turn this off to start with exactly vanilla's. Vanilla's own are never removed, and Psionic Adepts are unaffected.
{{y|Set this before creating a character.}}

Keeps this fork's eased attribute requirements. {{W|Axe}} and {{W|Cudgel}}
powers accept Strength {{y|or}} Agility. {{W|En Garde!}} needs 29 in either
rather than 29 and 23 in both. {{W|Multiweapon Expertise}} and {{W|Mastery}}
ask 21 and 25 rather than 23 and 27.

Off restores vanilla's. Skills you already own are never taken back.
{{W|Tinkering}} is vanilla's either way.

{{y|Takes effect when you restart the game.}}

Gives Mutated Humans {{G|+300}} reputation with Joppa at character creation.
{{y|Off by default}}, unlike the rest of this mod. It grants power with nothing attached to use it, so it is the kind of change you should have to ask for.
{{y|Set this before creating a character.}}
